# Go
/bin/
*.exe
*.test

# Node / frontend (M2+)
node_modules/
dist/
/app/
/print/cards/
/print/composited/
/print/*.pdf

# Runtime data — never commit a child's save file or drive contents
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.corrupt-*

# Local models / built key contents (M3+/M4+)
models/*.gguf
bin/win/
bin/linux/

# Editor/OS cruft
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python (scripts/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# xiaoxin-static/ is Crayon Shin-chan -- a copyrighted commercial character supplied
# alongside the other (original/generated) pet assets. Deliberately never wired into the
# app (see characters.ts, DECISIONS.md) and untracked here so it can't be re-added by
# accident. It was briefly committed at ac4a823 before this; still in git history, not
# just this working tree, since removing it from history entirely needs an explicit
# rewrite this project hasn't been asked for.
/xiaoxin-static/

# strawberry-pochacco/ is the raw cursor-pack source drop (includes cursors this project
# never uses, plus scratch files from extracting a static frame out of an .ani). The
# actual product assets are the renamed copies in web/public/cursors/, which ARE
# tracked -- this stays untracked so a future `git add -A` can't sweep the whole source
# pack in again the way an earlier session's broad add once did with the pet character
# drops (see DECISIONS.md).
/strawberry-pochacco/
